<view class="page-shell quiz-page"><view class="eyebrow">趣味自我探索 · RECHARGE</view><view class="title">{{title}}</view><block wx:if="{{!started}}"><view class="intro-art"><view class="intro-orbit"><text class="intro-symbol">✦</text></view><view class="intro-caption">留白 · 陪伴 · 探索 · 秩序</view></view><view class="intro">跟着此刻的偏好选择。没有标准答案，只有现在更适合你的节奏。</view><view class="quiz-facts"><text>8 道题</text><text>约 2 分钟</text><text>可随时续答</text></view><button class="primary-button wide" style="width:100%" bindtap="start">{{draft ? '继续上次测试 · 已答 ' + draft.answers.length + '/8' : '开始测试'}}</button><button wx:if="{{draft}}" class="text-button" style="width:100%" bindtap="restart">重新开始</button><view class="note">趣味偏好测试，不作为心理诊断。作答草稿仅保存在当前设备，不会随结果分享。</view></block><block wx:else><view class="progress-row"><text>问题 {{index + 1}} <text class="total">/ {{total}}</text></text><text>凭此刻的感受选择</text></view><view class="progress"><view style="width:{{(index + 1) / total * 100}}%"></view></view><view class="question">{{question.title}}</view><button wx:for="{{question.options}}" wx:key="*this" style="width:100%" class="option {{selected === index ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="choose"><text class="option-number">0{{index + 1}}</text><text class="option-copy">{{item}}</text><view class="option-dot {{selected === index ? 'checked' : ''}}"></view></button><view class="quiz-actions"><button wx:if="{{index > 0}}" class="ghost-button quiz-nav" bindtap="previous">上一题</button><button class="primary-button quiz-nav {{selected < 0 ? 'is-disabled' : ''}}" disabled="{{selected < 0}}" bindtap="next">{{index === total - 1 ? '查看我的结果' : '下一题'}}</button></view><view class="note">{{!answers.length ? '选择后自动保留进度，可随时继续。' : draftSaved ? '进度已保存在本机，下次可以继续。' : '暂时未能保存进度，你可以继续本次答题。'}}</view></block></view>
